 "body_html": "<h2>Cómo se hace</h2><p>En 6 × 4 = 24, 6 y 4 son los <b>factores</b> y 24 es el <b>producto</b>.</p><p>El orden no importa: 6 × 4 = 4 × 6. Si sabes una, sabes la otra.</p><p>Trucos: la tabla del 4 es el doble de la del 2; la del 6, el doble de la del 3; la del 8, el doble de la del 4.</p><div class='qfig'><svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 232 160' width='232' height='160' role='img' aria-label='4 filas de 6 estrellas'><g font-family='Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif'><polygon points='26.0,14.0 29.4,22.8 38.8,23.3 31.5,29.3 33.9,38.4 26.0,33.3 18.1,38.4 20.5,29.3 13.2,23.3 22.6,22.8' fill='#f4c430' stroke='#a57c00' stroke-width='1.4'/><polygon points='62.0,14.0 65.4,22.8 74.8,23.3 67.5,29.3 69.9,38.4 62.0,33.3 54.1,38.4 56.5,29.3 49.2,23.3 58.6,22.8' fill='#f4c430' stroke='#a57c00' stroke-width='1.4'/><polygon points='98.0,14.0 101.4,22.8 110.8,23.3 103.5,29.3 105.9,38.4 98.0,33.3 90.1,38.4 92.5,29.3 85.2,23.3 94.6,22.8' fill='#f4c430' stroke='#a57c00' stroke-width='1.4'/><polygon points='134.0,14.0 137.4,22.8 146.8,23.3 139.5,29.3 141.9,38.4 134.0,33.3 126.1,38.4 128.5,29.3 121.2,23.3 130.6,22.8' fill='#f4c430' stroke='#a57c00' stroke-width='1.4'/><polygon points='170.0,14.0 173.4,22.8 182.8,23.3 175.5,29.3 177.9,38.4 170.0,33.3 162.1,38.4 164.5,29.3 157.2,23.3 166.6,22.8' fill='#f4c430' stroke='#a57c00' stroke-width='1.4'/><polygon points='206.0,14.0 209.4,22.8 218.8,23.3 211.5,29.3 213.9,38.4 206.0,33.3 198.1,38.4 200.5,29.3 193.2,23.3 202.6,22.8' fill='#f4c430' stroke='#a57c00' stroke-width='1.4'/><polygon points='26.0,50.0 29.4,58.8 38.8,59.3 31.5,65.3 33.9,74.4 26.0,69.3 18.1,74.4 20.5,65.3 13.2,59.3 22.6,58.8' fill='#f4c430' stroke='#a57c00' stroke-width='1.4'/><polygon points='62.0,50.0 65.4,58.8 74.8,59.3 67.5,65.3 69.9,74.4 62.0,69.3 54.1,74.4 56.5,65.3 49.2,59.3 58.6,58.8' fill='#f4c430' stroke='#a57c00' stroke-width='1.4'/><polygon points='98.0,50.0 101.4,58.8 110.8,59.3 103.5,65.3 105.9,74.4 98.0,69.3 90.1,74.4 92.5,65.3 85.